<https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_bipolar_disorder_efficacy> a oe:clinicalQuestion ;
  rdfs:label "How effective is lithium compared with other agents for Bipolar Disorder?" ;
  oe:hasAnswer [
    a oe:answer ;
    oe:hasGroundedEvidence [
      a oe:groundedEvidence ;
      oe:hasDrug <https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/lithium> ;
      oe:hasDisease <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/bipolar_disorder> ;
      oe:confidence 0.97 ;
      oe:level "Level-1A" ;
      oe:source <https://example.org/openevidence/sources/40844121> ;
      oe:effectiveness "effective"
    ]
  ] .
```

This Turtle includes the necessary prefix declarations, the subject of the clinical question, and the grounded evidence for lithium's effectiveness in treating Bipolar Disorder.
